    "title": "Illustrative partial-recovery sensitivity (v2 standoff, Oct 6 baseline)",
    "kind": "NOT issued, NOT published. Comparison line only: for each month, production halfway between the published v2 standoff production and the EIA baseline production; consumption identical to the v2 standoff; same September starting observation. Labeled 'illustrative partial recovery' \u2014 not 'half the Gulf recovery'. Nothing in the evidence locates the likely outcome halfway between the paths.",
