      "interpretation_note": "The sensitivity line ends 2027 still BELOW the end-Feb 2026 (pre-crisis) level but ABOVE the Aug 2026 anchor: inventories rebuild during 2027 (from the Dec 2026 trough) without recovering to the pre-crisis level. Rebuilding during the forecast and recovering to the prewar level are different statements; the midpoint's position halfway between the endpoints is a consequence of the construction (identical consumption and starting point), not independent evidence that a half recovery is likely."
